;; tsutae-factory-r0 — 生産工程 (manufacturing line / 製造プロセス),
;; Datomic-style EDN. SSoT for HOW a finished 伝え handheld is MADE — the ordered
;; line stations a device flows through, station-by-station, from component receiving
;; to ship-out + EOL. PRODUCTION counterpart of `construction.edn` (which builds the
;; CLEANROOM); the two are distinct layers (ADR-2606013100 §1 pattern).
;;
;; Each station maps to one of the 8 tsutae Pregel cells (orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-tsutae/cells):
;;   print+place+reflow+aoi → pcb_smt · chassis → chassis_assembly ·
;;   display → display_attachment · firmware → firmware_load · qc → final_qc ·
;;   pack → packaging · attest → device_attestation · eol → recycling_intake.
;;
;; `production_gen.py` validates this against the scene + building BOM and emits:
;;   - production.order.json — flat station list consumed by the kami-app
;;     `run_tsutae_factory_produce_v1` entry (a device advances through these
;;     stations on the conveyor; the assigned line robot works it).
;;   - production_ingest.json — prod/* + mfgop/* kotoba EAVT datoms.
;;
;; :station/op      receive | smt-print | smt-place | reflow | aoi | chassis |
;;                  display | firmware | qc | pack | attest | eol
;; :station/cell    line robot servicing the station (scene cell id)
;; :station/x :station/y  plan position the device occupies AT this station
;; :station/cycle-s nominal takt dwell (seconds)
;; :station/consumes building.edn :part/id drawn here (device dev:* or supply bld:*)
;; :station/maps-cell  the tsutae Pregel cell that governs this station

{:prod/meta
 {:prod/of      "tsutae-factory-r0"
  :prod/revision "v1"
  :prod/title   "伝え handheld — R0 production line (受入→SMT→筐体→ディスプレイ→FW→QC→梱包→出荷 / EOL)"
  :prod/takt-s  144
  :prod/rate-note "≤200 devices / 8-hr line (G12 anti-mass-production; NOT Samsung-class scale)"
  :prod/note    "R0 design line for the ADR-2605261300 8-cell process. The device flows along the conveyor spine; the EOL bench is a separate take-back path. Cycle times are representative takt figures, NOT a balanced-line study. Capability inactive (cells are R0 scaffold); this is the production-flow SIMULATION."}

 :prod/stations
